WEBVTT

00:24.023 --> 00:26.234
Well done, Xylo.

00:27.777 --> 00:30.280
I will grant you my praise too.

00:37.454 --> 00:38.872
Xylo Forbartz,

00:38.955 --> 00:41.750
you successfully defeated
the Demon Lord Iblis.

00:41.833 --> 00:43.543
Let's talk about what happens next.

00:43.626 --> 00:46.504
I'm not in the mood to hear
about troublesome things.

00:46.588 --> 00:48.256
No, you have to listen.

00:48.965 --> 00:50.300
It's necessary.

01:05.982 --> 01:08.151
Put that crate over here!

01:08.943 --> 01:10.320
There's more cargo coming.

01:13.573 --> 01:15.283
They're freshly caught.

01:21.247 --> 01:22.791
Hurry and move it.

01:44.562 --> 01:45.897
That's how it is.

01:45.980 --> 01:47.690
You and Lady Teoritta

01:47.774 --> 01:52.195
will be temporarily assigned to us,
the Thirteenth Order of the Holy Knights.

01:53.029 --> 01:54.322
"Assigned", you say...

01:54.405 --> 01:55.907
What are we, spare parts?

01:56.658 --> 01:59.619
As for Lady Teoritta's worrying position,

01:59.702 --> 02:02.205
the military and the Temple
had been constantly disputing.

02:02.914 --> 02:05.333
After achieving a huge victory
in the battle at the fortress,

02:05.416 --> 02:07.168
the situation began to change.

02:08.878 --> 02:13.007
Xylo, you must continue
to protect Lady Teoritta.

02:13.800 --> 02:15.593
If I'm going to protect her...

02:18.304 --> 02:20.390
I haven't even had a single day off.

02:21.015 --> 02:23.226
We should be transferred away
from the front lines for now.

02:23.309 --> 02:25.770
- That was my intention all along.
- What?

02:25.854 --> 02:30.650
Your duty as members of the hero unit
is to protect Lady Teoritta here

02:30.733 --> 02:33.236
in this port city, Ioff.

02:34.654 --> 02:37.323
Are you saying this city
is more dangerous than the battlefield?

02:38.032 --> 02:39.701
You are absolutely right.

02:40.285 --> 02:43.371
Some of the heretics
expelled from the Temple

02:43.454 --> 02:45.790
do not acknowledge
the existence of the new goddess.

02:46.374 --> 02:48.209
They might collude
with the order of assassins

02:48.293 --> 02:50.044
and try to harm Lady Teoritta.

02:50.128 --> 02:52.422
That's enough. I'll listen to you later.

02:52.505 --> 02:53.506
Xylo.

02:54.799 --> 02:57.427
You are to protect me.

02:57.510 --> 02:59.470
You and the other heroes

02:59.554 --> 03:02.265
are going on vacation, Xylo!

03:21.367 --> 03:22.160
Huh?

03:33.922 --> 03:37.133
I heard you took care
of some Demon Blight,

03:37.217 --> 03:38.259
Xylo.

03:38.343 --> 03:39.802
What the heck? It's you, Jayce.

03:40.762 --> 03:44.557
I heard you took down three Demon Lords.

03:44.641 --> 03:47.769
But I bet most of it was Dotta
and Norgalle's doing.

03:48.478 --> 03:50.521
As for Iblis,

03:50.605 --> 03:52.565
I'll count that as your kill.

03:53.441 --> 03:55.276
I took down two myself, you know.

03:56.611 --> 03:58.238
You're not bluffing, are you?

03:58.321 --> 04:00.740
Isn't Rhyno on the Western Front too?

04:00.823 --> 04:02.867
That guy disobeyed orders again.

04:02.951 --> 04:04.577
He'll be in the punishment room
for a while.

04:05.245 --> 04:07.789
A penal hero in the punishment room?

04:08.414 --> 04:12.001
In any case,
our score is two to one, so I win.

04:12.585 --> 04:14.128
Guess you're not so great after all.

04:14.212 --> 04:16.130
W-Wait a minute!

04:16.214 --> 04:17.882
Xylo is my knight.

04:17.966 --> 04:20.301
I will not allow you to belittle him.

04:20.385 --> 04:21.761
Are you the goddess?

04:21.844 --> 04:23.805
I heard Dotta picked you up.

04:24.389 --> 04:27.225
I'm so glad you're being protected
by a brat like her.

04:28.434 --> 04:30.853
H-How dare you speak to me like that?

04:30.937 --> 04:33.731
I have never felt
such a lack of respect before!

04:33.815 --> 04:36.985
Well, it's no use getting angry
at this guy.

04:37.068 --> 04:41.698
Dotta didn't find her.
He stole her from the Holy Knights.

04:42.824 --> 04:44.409
It's pretty much the same.

04:45.034 --> 04:46.953
I don't care about human rules.

04:47.620 --> 04:49.539
Come on, hand it over.

04:49.622 --> 04:51.416
Neely will get mad if I'm late.

04:53.876 --> 04:55.837
Give my regards to Neely.

05:01.092 --> 05:03.469
Xylo! Who is that?

05:03.970 --> 05:05.430
His name is Jayce.

05:05.513 --> 05:07.598
He's a dragoon in our unit.

05:07.682 --> 05:10.393
He's an idiot who grows illegal plants

05:10.476 --> 05:12.437
for dragons and then sells them.

05:12.520 --> 05:14.397
And that is how he became a hero?

05:14.480 --> 05:16.482
His second crime is mutiny.

05:16.566 --> 05:20.236
Apparently, he went against the military,
trying to liberate the dragons.

05:20.862 --> 05:23.740
Normally, he'd be arrested within a day.

05:23.823 --> 05:27.243
But he's a high noble,
and dragons are unusually fond of him.

05:27.869 --> 05:31.331
This led to a rebellion that would later
be known as "Jayce's revolt."

05:32.373 --> 05:36.711
Heroes really are an odd bunch...

05:42.967 --> 05:44.927
Excuse me...

05:49.474 --> 05:51.976
P-Please calm down, Xylo.

05:52.060 --> 05:53.102
Okay?

05:54.854 --> 05:56.397
P-Please wait a minute!

05:56.481 --> 05:58.941
If the Mastibolt family
hadn't sent reinforcements,

05:59.025 --> 06:02.111
the damage would've been worse, right?

06:02.195 --> 06:04.697
Yes, so I'll forgive you
if you let me punch you twice.

06:04.781 --> 06:07.408
Xylo! Do not resort to violence!

06:07.492 --> 06:08.576
It's fine.

06:08.659 --> 06:10.828
He's still hiding something from me.

06:10.912 --> 06:12.830
N-No, that's not true.

06:12.914 --> 06:14.665
Oh, speaking of which,

06:14.749 --> 06:16.334
Frenci told me

06:16.417 --> 06:21.172
I had to make sure you meet her,
or she'll kill me tomorrow.

06:21.255 --> 06:23.883
Frenci? Who is she?

06:24.467 --> 06:26.344
She was once my fiancée.

06:28.221 --> 06:29.097
What?

06:33.768 --> 06:35.520
How embarrassing, Xylo.

06:37.563 --> 06:40.441
What are you doing? Hurry up and sit down.

06:43.236 --> 06:46.239
There's no sign of improvement.

06:46.322 --> 06:48.533
You used to be like a fly,

06:48.616 --> 06:50.076
but now you're just a caterpillar.

06:50.159 --> 06:51.119
That's terrible.

06:52.411 --> 06:55.081
Could you not compare people
to weird things?

06:55.164 --> 06:59.085
Oh? Is that considered
an insult among commoners?

06:59.752 --> 07:04.590
I just don't want you to tarnish the image
of the Mastibolt family's son-in-law.

07:04.674 --> 07:06.968
That's where we differ.

07:07.051 --> 07:08.970
Then I'll change.

07:09.053 --> 07:11.389
I didn't mean to upset you.

07:14.892 --> 07:16.936
So this is the goddess?

07:17.019 --> 07:19.063
Don't glare at her. She'll get scared.

07:19.147 --> 07:20.982
I-I am not scared!

07:21.065 --> 07:22.650
I am a goddess, you know.

07:23.526 --> 07:26.654
Yes, and I'm not glaring at her.

07:26.737 --> 07:29.031
You are Frenci, right?

07:29.115 --> 07:32.452
What is your relationship
with my knight, Xylo?

07:32.535 --> 07:35.163
I told you just now, she's my ex-fiancée.

07:35.246 --> 07:37.874
I'm not your "ex."

07:37.957 --> 07:40.626
The vows are still valid, Xylo.

07:40.710 --> 07:43.963
Don't be ridiculous. I'm a hero.

07:44.046 --> 07:45.882
I have no right to marry.

07:45.965 --> 07:49.093
- Uh-huh.
- Legally, I'm not even human.

07:49.177 --> 07:51.012
"Frenci," was it?

07:51.095 --> 07:53.639
This man is a hero and my knight.

07:53.723 --> 07:56.767
It is his life's work
to devote himself entirely

07:56.851 --> 07:58.936
to using me and singing my praises.

07:59.020 --> 08:02.231
Although I feel sorry for you,

08:02.315 --> 08:04.066
he cannot get married!

08:04.150 --> 08:07.528
Xylo, it looks like someone strange
has taken a liking to you again.

08:08.279 --> 08:12.158
That reminds me of my father's
long-eared armadillo. It liked you too.

08:12.241 --> 08:15.328
Yes, and it scratched you.

08:15.411 --> 08:16.954
That was a merchant from the West...

08:17.038 --> 08:18.664
W-Wait a minute!

08:18.748 --> 08:20.917
Bringing up the past is unfair!

08:21.000 --> 08:24.253
And you compared a goddess
to that weird animal.

08:24.337 --> 08:25.713
That is too disrespectful!

08:25.796 --> 08:31.135
Anyway,
I'm thinking of a way to get you pardoned.

08:31.219 --> 08:32.720
Hold on, I--

08:32.803 --> 08:35.056
And I'll be staying here for a while.

08:35.806 --> 08:36.849
After all...

08:36.933 --> 08:40.561
I have to pursue the Demon Blight.

08:44.190 --> 08:45.233
What do you mean?

08:45.816 --> 08:47.443
It's just as I said.

08:48.027 --> 08:49.529
For about a month now,

08:49.612 --> 08:53.866
I've been fighting the Demon Blight
with the lords of the night-gaunts.

08:53.950 --> 08:55.284
However, a few days ago,

08:55.368 --> 08:58.246
the Demon Lord's army
disappeared around this town.

08:58.329 --> 08:59.205
Disappeared?

08:59.288 --> 09:02.583
Yes, Demon Blight Number Fifty-Nine,

09:02.667 --> 09:03.876
Spriggan.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.169
I'm afraid that thing...

09:06.045 --> 09:08.130
has taken human form.

09:09.048 --> 09:11.133
A Demon Lord disguised as a human...

09:11.217 --> 09:12.093
Spriggan.

09:12.176 --> 09:15.096
It's a rare ability
even among Demon Lords.

09:15.179 --> 09:17.056
Damn it, this is troublesome.

09:18.015 --> 09:20.935
It might've infiltrated this town.

09:21.435 --> 09:22.687
Be careful.

09:22.770 --> 09:25.773
After all, it wiped out a city
in our territory.

09:26.524 --> 09:29.318
Well then, that concludes our visit.

09:31.988 --> 09:34.740
Who's listening in over there?

09:34.824 --> 09:37.326
No, I didn't mean anything by it...

09:38.244 --> 09:39.370
It's a rule.

09:39.453 --> 09:41.956
The supervisor must be present
for any meeting with the hero...

09:42.039 --> 09:44.041
I see. I'll be going, then.

09:44.875 --> 09:47.587
You need to come up
with a better excuse next time.

09:56.262 --> 09:58.347
I am definitely going!

09:58.431 --> 10:00.766
I heard about it from Venetim and Dotta.

10:00.850 --> 10:04.478
I hear the town is packed with rare goods
from both the West and the North.

10:04.562 --> 10:06.439
And you can eat your fill
of just about any dish.

10:06.522 --> 10:09.650
The only one who could pull that off
is Dotta, with his sticky fingers.

10:10.484 --> 10:12.403
Besides, we're not fooling around.

10:13.029 --> 10:14.780
The Temple heretics...

10:14.864 --> 10:17.366
We're going to lure out
whoever's after your life

10:17.450 --> 10:18.367
and wipe them out in one go.

10:18.451 --> 10:20.620
Yes, I know.

10:20.703 --> 10:22.204
Of course, I know.

10:22.955 --> 10:23.831
Let me make this clear first.

10:24.832 --> 10:26.792
Don't tell anyone about the Holy Sword.

10:29.420 --> 10:32.882
If Galtuile finds out,
things will get more complicated...

10:32.965 --> 10:34.425
It will be okay.

10:34.508 --> 10:36.135
I am a goddess, you know.

10:36.218 --> 10:37.345
There is no need to worry!

10:39.096 --> 10:41.265
I'll go into town with you.

10:41.349 --> 10:44.477
When push comes to shove,
I can be the goddess's shield and sword.

10:45.227 --> 10:46.062
Huh?

10:46.145 --> 10:47.521
All that's left...

10:48.439 --> 10:50.483
is to decide who to take.

10:50.566 --> 10:53.069
Venetim can't handle guard duty.

10:53.736 --> 10:57.365
We can't let Dotta roam the streets
without handcuffs either.

10:58.115 --> 11:01.994
His Majesty will start complaining
that he wants his own bodyguards too.

11:02.078 --> 11:03.579
As for Tatsuya...

11:05.081 --> 11:06.916
It's better not to let him
go out in public.

11:07.625 --> 11:09.835
My options are pretty limited, huh?

11:20.054 --> 11:24.183
Those idiots made Neely live
in a place like this.

11:24.266 --> 11:27.478
At least make it big enough
for her to spread her wings and tail.

11:28.062 --> 11:30.022
Hey, Jayce...

11:30.106 --> 11:32.817
I have work to do as a commander.

11:32.900 --> 11:34.443
Can I go back?

11:35.152 --> 11:37.905
Who's the strongest member of this unit?

11:37.988 --> 11:40.616
You and Neely.

11:44.620 --> 11:48.165
Then keep her in tip-top condition

11:48.249 --> 11:50.334
and shut up, conman.

11:50.918 --> 11:53.212
Just wait a little longer, Neely.

11:53.295 --> 11:55.548
I'll build you a nice bed soon.

11:57.425 --> 11:58.592
Hmm?

11:59.135 --> 12:03.139
I was just measuring
the other dragons' height.

12:03.222 --> 12:05.099
I didn't look under their wings.

12:05.933 --> 12:07.393
I didn't look.

12:07.476 --> 12:08.644
I swear.

12:10.396 --> 12:12.773
- This is going to take a long time.
- Have I ever lied to you?

12:12.857 --> 12:14.150
Wait...

12:14.859 --> 12:16.360
That's because she came to see me.

12:16.444 --> 12:18.779
- Is he really the only one left?
- I had no choice but to measure her.

12:33.002 --> 12:36.672
No, those guys were really out of line.

12:36.755 --> 12:39.341
The name of the order is Gwen Mohsa.

12:39.425 --> 12:42.178
Even I, who grew up there, thought,

12:42.261 --> 12:44.930
"Ah... this really
is an evil secret society."

12:45.014 --> 12:48.559
There's also a ritual where children
are sacrificed to the goddess.

12:48.642 --> 12:50.769
It's called the "Holy Communion."

12:50.853 --> 12:52.271
- That's really...
- Alright, that's enough.

12:52.354 --> 12:53.230
Yes.

12:53.314 --> 12:54.899
If we're so noisy,

12:54.982 --> 12:57.234
there's no point in disguising ourselves.

12:58.569 --> 12:59.487
By the way...

13:02.531 --> 13:04.450
- It looks good on you.
- Huh?

13:05.201 --> 13:06.827
Didn't expect you
to disguise yourself as a man.

13:07.745 --> 13:09.163
You're perfect as a bodyguard.

13:13.417 --> 13:15.085
Look, Xylo.

13:15.169 --> 13:17.505
Do you want to buy a present?

13:17.588 --> 13:19.173
To commemorate today?

13:19.256 --> 13:20.549
Commemorate what?

13:20.633 --> 13:24.136
To commemorate the first time
the great goddess and her knight

13:24.220 --> 13:26.013
walked the streets together.

13:26.639 --> 13:27.723
I see...

13:28.224 --> 13:29.975
So, what do you want?

13:30.059 --> 13:32.561
You are going to choose with me.

13:32.645 --> 13:34.939
Didn't I say this was
to commemorate the two of us?

13:40.694 --> 13:42.780
What do you think of this cloth?

13:42.863 --> 13:45.074
Doesn't it sparkle?

13:45.157 --> 13:49.036
It's all brought here
from the West across Korio Bay.

13:49.119 --> 13:50.287
There are many rare
and precious items here.

13:50.371 --> 13:52.456
Look, there is even that bracelet.

13:52.540 --> 13:55.000
Don't you think it suits me?

13:55.084 --> 13:58.754
Jadeite? It's so expensive
that you can buy a house with it.

13:58.837 --> 14:00.464
I wouldn't want to bring Dotta here.

14:00.548 --> 14:02.675
I am not asking you about its price.

14:02.758 --> 14:04.760
And Dotta is not a problem
right now either.

14:06.011 --> 14:07.012
Tsav.

14:07.096 --> 14:09.139
In this situation, what would you do?

14:10.474 --> 14:12.393
In a crowd?

14:12.476 --> 14:14.603
The best way is to pretend
to be a random killer.

14:15.729 --> 14:18.440
Xylo, are you listening to me?

14:18.524 --> 14:20.943
I want you to choose.

14:21.026 --> 14:22.069
Alright, alright...

14:29.326 --> 14:31.495
If it's this one,
I can tell if it's good or not.

14:31.579 --> 14:32.830
A knife...?

14:32.913 --> 14:33.956
No good?

14:34.039 --> 14:36.125
Well, it's pretty dangerous
for a child to hold a knife.

14:36.208 --> 14:38.335
I can learn how to use it from you!

14:38.419 --> 14:39.753
Just choose one.

14:41.297 --> 14:42.214
In that case...

14:45.551 --> 14:47.052
How about this one?

14:51.181 --> 14:52.641
It's nice.

14:52.725 --> 14:53.893
So pretty.

14:56.228 --> 14:57.187
I'll take this one.

14:58.522 --> 14:59.773
And this one too.

15:00.649 --> 15:01.692
I'll pay in military scrip.

15:07.740 --> 15:10.200
Teoritta. Use it if you're in a pinch.

15:10.910 --> 15:11.952
What?

15:35.225 --> 15:37.603
No!

15:42.066 --> 15:44.944
Oh, this looks good.

15:48.572 --> 15:50.866
Xylo, take the second route!

15:50.950 --> 15:51.951
Right.

15:52.034 --> 15:53.327
Let's go, Teoritta.

15:53.410 --> 15:55.579
I-It's already started?

15:56.413 --> 15:58.791
Sorry, we'll take
a different route for our walk.

16:16.433 --> 16:17.643
What's going on?

16:17.726 --> 16:19.269
Why aren't the Holy Knights here?

16:19.353 --> 16:20.938
This is bad.

16:21.021 --> 16:22.940
We can only assume
that something happened.

16:23.023 --> 16:26.527
They're not assassins from the order.

16:26.610 --> 16:29.488
They don't seem like they've been trained.

16:29.571 --> 16:33.492
In that case, it could be the faction
that's in league with the Demon Blight.

16:34.660 --> 16:36.120
The coexisters?

16:37.413 --> 16:40.749
At the very least, they're a group
that benefits from killing the goddess.

16:40.833 --> 16:43.377
Though I've always believed
they haven't infiltrated the military...

16:47.840 --> 16:49.341
Whoa, that's gross!

16:58.267 --> 17:00.144
What's with this guy...

17:03.605 --> 17:06.900
Seems like there's a trick to it, bro...

17:08.610 --> 17:10.446
It hurts like hell!

17:11.030 --> 17:12.906
Xylo, I...

17:13.490 --> 17:15.868
Stay back. I'll finish him now.

17:41.185 --> 17:42.519
Stop!

17:54.073 --> 17:55.240
A seal compound?

17:57.034 --> 17:58.160
Take that!

18:05.042 --> 18:05.876
Can you still fight?

18:05.959 --> 18:07.586
Who do you think you're talking to?

18:07.669 --> 18:08.962
Cut the crap!

18:13.425 --> 18:15.969
That's enough, Shiji Bau.

18:16.470 --> 18:19.723
Your opponent is the goddess
and the penal hero.

18:19.807 --> 18:22.309
Your chances of winning
are one in a thousand.

18:22.392 --> 18:24.436
It's time to retreat.

18:26.438 --> 18:28.565
Did you hear me, Shiji Bau?

18:28.649 --> 18:31.318
Jeez, you're such an amateur.

18:31.401 --> 18:33.612
Don't call others
by their names so casually.

18:33.695 --> 18:34.822
Boojum.

18:34.905 --> 18:37.574
I see. So that's how it is.

18:37.658 --> 18:40.035
I don't know much about the business,

18:40.619 --> 18:42.871
so please continue
to teach me as my senior...

18:42.955 --> 18:45.499
Sir, if we don't hurry,
the Holy Knights will...

18:45.582 --> 18:47.126
Silence.

18:47.209 --> 18:49.586
I'm talking to Shiji Bau.

18:49.670 --> 18:52.214
It's rude to interrupt others
when they're talking.

18:55.342 --> 18:58.512
Weren't you told not to kill
indiscriminately?

18:58.595 --> 19:00.097
Kill?

19:00.180 --> 19:02.224
I didn't do such a thing.

19:02.307 --> 19:03.517
That's way too cruel.

19:04.268 --> 19:06.019
But you smashed his jaw.

19:06.103 --> 19:09.648
You really are a lunatic.

19:10.482 --> 19:11.567
Kivia!

19:12.776 --> 19:14.069
Niskeph!

19:19.658 --> 19:21.451
Don't fire your lightning staff.

19:21.535 --> 19:23.662
It'll sting a little
if it hits me in the back.

19:55.110 --> 19:59.114
Penal hero...
Are you the legendary Xylo Forbartz?

19:59.865 --> 20:02.576
You're Boojum, right?

20:02.659 --> 20:04.494
Were you in a circus?

20:04.578 --> 20:05.579
No.

20:05.662 --> 20:08.207
You're the one who's good
at throwing knives.

20:08.290 --> 20:10.083
I think you're more suited for the circus.

20:10.167 --> 20:12.920
Yes, to be honest,
I was in one for about three years.

20:13.503 --> 20:15.047
I'm quite good at trapezing too.

20:15.130 --> 20:17.466
Really? No wonder.

20:18.008 --> 20:22.888
Of all the people I know,
you're the best in the world.

20:22.971 --> 20:24.431
I respect you.

20:26.058 --> 20:28.518
Boojum, you talk too much.

20:28.602 --> 20:30.896
Don't give them unnecessary information.

20:30.979 --> 20:33.357
I see. So that's how it is.

20:33.440 --> 20:34.441
I've learned another thing.

20:34.524 --> 20:36.860
These guys are bad news.

20:36.944 --> 20:40.739
That woman
is a famous adventurer, Shiji Bau.

20:41.490 --> 20:44.868
Unlike you, she seems to have
a high success rate in killing.

20:44.952 --> 20:46.036
Right?

20:46.119 --> 20:48.789
I'm kind and everyone loves me...

20:52.292 --> 20:54.670
Xylo, I will rain down swords upon them....

20:54.753 --> 20:55.921
Forget it.

20:56.004 --> 20:57.422
But if it were me...

20:57.506 --> 21:02.386
I know how painful it is
for a goddess to hurt a human.

21:03.220 --> 21:07.599
But there is something strange...
There is a very strange feeling...

21:08.433 --> 21:10.310
Bro, they're here!

21:10.394 --> 21:12.521
Yes, they made it in time, didn't they?

21:13.313 --> 21:14.439
Huh...

21:14.523 --> 21:15.482
Hm?

21:29.871 --> 21:31.498
Help... help!

21:40.257 --> 21:41.466
Oh.

21:41.550 --> 21:44.344
You called us to such a cramped place.

21:44.428 --> 21:45.929
You should thank Neely.

21:46.013 --> 21:48.390
Yes. Sorry, Neely.

21:48.473 --> 21:50.392
We're saved, Neely!

21:52.019 --> 21:54.313
Ah, Neely is so kind.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.982
Of course, we'll go on vacation again.

21:57.065 --> 21:58.775
Let's fly to the beach tomorrow.

22:00.944 --> 22:02.779
I see.

22:02.863 --> 22:04.823
A dragon's flames are unbearable.

22:10.912 --> 22:12.873
Not enough blood.

22:12.956 --> 22:14.708
I've learned my lesson.

22:14.791 --> 22:17.836
Well then, I'll be... going now.

22:23.550 --> 22:24.843
What's the deal with him?

22:25.510 --> 22:27.637
He was burned by Neely's flames...

22:29.222 --> 22:30.098
Teoritta.

22:30.766 --> 22:32.642
What were you trying to say?

22:32.726 --> 22:34.603
About that hunchback man.

22:35.771 --> 22:37.647
To be precise, I do not know.

22:38.148 --> 22:39.524
It is just that for some reason,

22:39.608 --> 22:42.569
when I wanted to attack,
the resistance I felt towards that man

22:42.652 --> 22:44.237
seemed a little weaker...

22:46.615 --> 22:47.949
Perhaps...

22:48.033 --> 22:50.869
that man might be Spriggan.
